  "interpretation": "The x-dependent PDF zero is above the mass-only protected boundary. It is not an out-of-grid extrapolation, floating-point near-zero artefact, or a bottom PDF entry. A fixed charm threshold alone does not describe the native positive shower PDF support.",
  "kernel_Q2_GeV2": 2283.313521912757,
  "limits": "This independently diagnoses the exact failed point, not the population frequency or a generic proof of forced-heavy shower treatment. Any matching fix must act consistently on H and S and keep the original source events.",
